+original failure; no causal claim, retry, matrix clearance or main integration.
+After its one result report phase/progress/state/usage and a bounded next proposal;
+hold all further edits/runs for parent direction. Macro/current+next-two scope
+remains unchanged. This subsection is planned diagnostics, not implemented proof.
